  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "...All right, I'll prepare a\ndifferent training regimen. Come\nthis way, pi.",
      "_offset": 10,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Hahaha! We did it, Gomamon! This\nis my specialty!",
      "_offset": 86,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Personally, I'm not that good at\nusing my head...",
      "_offset": 136,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "It doesn't really matter what kind\nof training it is! I'm looking\nforward to it!",
      "_offset": 186,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Piccolomon said that we just have\nto make it to the back, but...\nwhat's there?",
      "_offset": 267,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "It's too dark, I can't see\nanything...",
      "_offset": 346,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Hm? Something's coming from the\nother side.",
      "_offset": 385,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "...A Digimon?",
      "_offset": 429,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "W-what's that...?",
      "_offset": 443,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "M-me...?",
      "_offset": 461,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "You see, I have an entrance exam\nnext year, so I need to train\nmyself at competition.",
      "_offset": 470,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Hahaha! He acts just like you,\nJou!",
      "_offset": 556,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "He's saying what I said, right\ndown to the letter!",
      "_offset": 592,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Whaaaaat?! Well... I don't really\nhave a lot of stamina...",
      "_offset": 643,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Don't you have any special\ntraining to improve one's\ncompetitive focus or anything?",
      "_offset": 702,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "...The heck? All he does is\ncomplain...",
      "_offset": 790,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Yup! Just like you, Jou!",
      "_offset": 830,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Is that... me?",
      "_offset": 855,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I came here to train myself, but\nall I've done is whine...",
      "_offset": 870,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "How embarrassing.",
      "_offset": 929,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "He's gone!",
      "_offset": 947,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "...Hey, Gomamon. Let's go back to\nPiccolomon.",
      "_offset": 958,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "But what about the training?",
      "_offset": 1004,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I think that was the training.",
      "_offset": 1033,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Good job returning, pi!",
      "_offset": 1064,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "You were the one who put that\nother me in the cave, weren't you?",
      "_offset": 1088,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Indeed, pi.",
      "_offset": 1153,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "I came here to train, but I was \nalready good at what I wanted to \ndo, so I just embarrassed myself.",
      "_offset": 1165,
      "_length": 100,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "The fact that you've realized this\non your own means that you've\ngrown significantly, pi.",
      "_offset": 1266,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Hey, Piccolomon praised you!\nThat's great, Jou!",
      "_offset": 1356,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Prepare yourself for more rigorous\ntraining from now on, pi. Here's\nsomething special for you, pi.",
      "_offset": 1404,
      "_length": 98,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Thanks, Piccolomon!",
      "_offset": 1503,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "If you ever want to come train\nagain, come at any time, pi!",
      "_offset": 1523,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Okay! We'll be back for sure!",
      "_offset": 1583,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Bye-bye, Piccolomon!",
      "_offset": 1613,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "~Test~",
      "_offset": 1634,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Clear episode.",
      "_offset": 1641,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}